+    # We assume we have a mask or weight indicating which Gaussian contributes to which pixel.
+    # For the purpose of this article, we assume a simplified per-pixel normal alignment loss
+    # is computed and backpropagated to the contributing Gaussians.
+    
+    # Note: Exact backpropagation of normal consistency to Gaussian parameters
